<title>CANADA: Canada Jan petroleum product sales rise 2.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada Jan petroleum product sales rise 2.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics Canada on Monday issued the following data for sales of refined petroleum products:</p>
<p>PETROLEUM PRODUCT SALES (thousands of cubic meters)</p>
<p>				    Jan 1997     Jan 1996	 pct</p>
<p>   Total sales		  7,406.4	7,223.9	 +2.5</p>
<p>   Motor gasoline	     2,830.2	2,780.6	 +1.8</p>
<p>   Diesel fuel		  1,646.5	1,482.1	+11.1</p>
<p>   Light fuel oil		 898.8	  954.2	 -5.8</p>
<p>   Heavy fuel oil		 624.8	  605.3	 +3.2</p>
<p>   Aviation turbo fuels	 420.7	  429.5	 -2.0</p>
<p>   Petrochemical feedstocks   382.9	  366.7	+4.4</p>
<p>   All other products	   602.5	  605.5	-0.5</p>
<p>(For more information from Statistics Canada, contact David Roeske, Energy Section, (613) 951-3563.)</p>
<p>((Reuters Ottawa Bureau (613) 235-6745))</p>
</text>
